<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine bolsa suspends shares of Cadipsa.</title>
<headline>Argentine bolsa suspends shares of Cadipsa.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Buenos Aires Stock Exchange said it has suspended trade in the shares of oil company Cadipsa SA from Friday.</p>
<p>The Stock Exchange said the move came after Cadipsa decided to withdraw its stock from listing from November 25.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
</text>
